{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56230","headline":"题东林寺四首（之一） · 贯休","name":"题东林寺四首（之一）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲行闲坐思攀缘，多是东林古寺前。\n小瀑便高三百尺，短松多是一千年。\n卢楞伽画苔漫（同书卷二引「浸」）尽，殷仲堪碑雨滴穿。\n今欲更崇莲社去，不知谁是古诸贤。\n（见《古石庵丛书》本《庐山记》卷四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}